              "stdout": "<class 'str'>\n[{\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Best International Schools in Bangkok (2026 Guide)\", \"url\": \"https://blog.doris.school/best-international-schools-in-bangkok\", \"content\": \"What\\u2019s the best international school in Bangkok? There\\u2019s no single \\u201cbest\\u201d, each school offers different strengths. Families often shortlist **Dulwich College Bangkok, St.\\n\\n# Best International Schools in Bangkok (2026 Guide)\\n### Best International Schools in Bangkok (2025 Overview)\\n\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| Dulwich College International School Bangkok View Dulwich College Bangkok School Profile  | British, IGCSE, A Levels | 2\\u201318 | Follows the English National Curriculum with IGCSE and A Level qualifications |\\n\\nAndrews International School Bangkok View St Andrews International School Bangkok \\u00a0School Profile  | British, IB Diploma | 2\\u201318 | Offers the English National Curriculum through to the IB Diploma Programme |\\n\\n### Other International Schools in Bangkok\\n\\nBangkok has a broad selection of international schools serving different curricula and family preferences. The following schools are also part of the city\\u2019s international education landscape:\\n\\n### Other International Schools in Bangkok\\n**Harrow International School Bangkok** \\u2013 Offers the English National Curriculum with boarding options and co-curricular programmes.\\n\\n**International School Bangkok (ISB)** \\u2013 Combines an American curriculum framework with IB and AP course availability.\\n\\n**Shrewsbury International School Bangkok** \\u2013 Provides an English National Curriculum pathway from early years to A Levels.\\n\\n**What\\u2019s the best international school in Bangkok?** There\\u2019s no single \\u201cbest\\u201d, each school offers different strengths.\\n\\n**Which international schools offer IB in Bangkok?** NIST, St.\", \"page_age\": \"8 days ago\"}, {\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Top 10 Best International Schools in Bangkok 2026\", \"url\": \"https://www.thailandprivilege.co.th/why-thailand/best-international-schools-bangkok\", \"content\": \"**International School Bangkok (ISB)** \\u2026 3. St Andrew's International School Bangkok \\u2026 4. **KIS International School Reignwood Park**\\n\\n# Best International Schools in Bangkok for Expat Children\\n## The 10 Best International Schools in Bangkok for Expat Families\\nThe schools listed below represent a cross section of the best schools in Bangkok for expats, selected across curricula, age range, and community profile.\\n\\nInternational School Bangkok (ISB)**\\n\\nISB is one of Bangkok's oldest and most established international schools, consistently recognized for its academic rigor, extensive extracurricular programs, and large, diverse student community drawn from over 50 nationalities.\\n\\nRegent's International School Bangkok**\\n\\nSt Andrew's International School Bangkok**\\n\\nKIS International School Reignwood Park**\\n\\nGarden International School Bangkok**\\n\\nAustralian International School Bangkok (AISB\n",
